{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019smGWmFTUXv7YUaQehQ4Xr","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 2a940b63b53dd3afdada854fe1a503b1dfb8d333\nAuthor: pinxbot <pinxbot@pinxbots-MacBook-Pro.local>\nDate:   Thu Mar 19 22:33:25 2026 +0900\n\n    feat: EmployeeMapper integration tests + fix CGLIB/Java 17+ incompatibility (Item 12)\n    \n    20 integration tests covering all 9 mapper methods against H2 in-memory DB:\n    insert (generated id), findById, findAll (pagination), update, delete,\n    countAll, searchByNameOrDepartment (name-only, dept-only, OR logic,\n    case-insensitive, pagination), countBySearch, findByEmail.\n    \n    Also adds --add-opens java.base/{java.lang,java.lang.reflect,java.io}=ALL-UNNAMED\n    to maven-surefire-plugin argLine so Spring 4.3.x CGLIB can generate @Configuration\n    proxy subclasses on Java 9+ (CGLIB uses reflection to call the protected\n    ClassLoader.defineClass() method, which the module system blocks by default).\n    Without this fix, all future integration test items (13, 14, 17-19) would fail\n    with ExceptionInInitializerError: null inside org.springframework.cglib.proxy.Enhancer.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nexamples/asis-legacy/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\nexamples/asis-legacy/LEARNINGS.md\nexamples/asis-legacy/pom.xml\nexamples/asis-legacy/progress.txt\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/pinxbot/Desktop/ralph_loop/examples/asis-legacy","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65e1815d-40a4-4def-9b3d-354e1ab2bece","uuid":"2fc63733-0102-4f3a-a03c-1d2e768a3daf","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"commit 2a940b63b53dd3afdada854fe1a503b1dfb8d333\nAuthor: pinxbot <pinxbot@pinxbots-MacBook-Pro.local>\nDate:   Thu Mar 19 22:33:25 2026 +0900\n\n    feat: EmployeeMapper integration tests + fix CGLIB/Java 17+ incompatibility (Item 12)\n    \n    20 integration tests covering all 9 mapper methods against H2 in-memory DB:\n    insert (generated id), findById, findAll (pagination), update, delete,\n    countAll, searchByNameOrDepartment (name-only, dept-only, OR logic,\n    case-insensitive, pagination), countBySearch, findByEmail.\n    \n    Also adds --add-opens java.base/{java.lang,java.lang.reflect,java.io}=ALL-UNNAMED\n    to maven-surefire-plugin argLine so Spring 4.3.x CGLIB can generate @Configuration\n    proxy subclasses on Java 9+ (CGLIB uses reflection to call the protected\n    ClassLoader.defineClass() method, which the module system blocks by default).\n    Without this fix, all future integration test items (13, 14, 17-19) would fail\n    with ExceptionInInitializerError: null inside org.springframework.cglib.proxy.Enhancer.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nexamples/asis-legacy/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\nexamples/asis-legacy/LEARNINGS.md\nexamples/asis-legacy/pom.xml\nexamples/asis-legacy/progress.txt","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/pinxbot/Desktop/ralph_loop/examples/asis-legacy","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
